// Hannibal hideout container #2: native, disarmable Magic Missile trap.
// Unlike v4.6 this script never runs on a True() trigger.
// The engine's container flags/difficulty permit detecting and disarming.
// Native containers with trap reset disabled are one-use; the separate
// GLOBAL guard also prevents a second cast if this BCS receives a repeat event.
IF
  Opened([ANYONE])
  Global("QH_TRAP_02_USED","GLOBAL",0)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("QH_TRAP_02_USED","GLOBAL",1)
    ReallyForceSpellRES("SPWI112",LastTrigger)
END
